01AB:                   
01AB:                   **************************************************
01AB:                   * System Call: F$AProc
01AB:                   *
01AB:                   * Function: Insert process into active process queue
01AB:                   *
01AB:                   * Input:  X = Address of process descriptor
01AB:                   *
01AB:                   * Output: None (U and Y are preserved)
01AB:                   *
01AB:                   * Error:  CC = C bit set; B = error code
01AB:                   *
01AB:                   *              "An Ode to Dr. Lee"
01AB:                   *             (1:27PM, Feb 23, 2006)
01AB:                   *
01AB:                   *   Sitting in CMPS 455, I listen to Dr. Lee,
01AB:                   *   His teaching style is as awful as any can be.
01AB:                   *   Operating System Principles I have seen many times before,
01AB:                   *   And as a result, this class is a major bore.
01AB:                   *   As he talks about file systems, I work on NitrOS-9,
01AB:                   *   even though I pay no attention, I do not fall behind.
01AB:                   *
01AB:                   *                                  - Anonymous Student who returned
01AB:                   *                                    to university to complete his
01AB:                   *                                    computer science degree while working
01AB:                   *                                    on The NitrOS-9 Project.
01AB:                   *
