059E: 301F              L0604    leax  -1,x                     backup into free memory bitmap
05A0: 9C20                       cmpx  <D.FMBM          did we move past the begining?
05A2: 2516                       bcs   L0620            branch if so
05A4: A684              L060A    lda   ,x                       get byte in current location in free memory bitmap
05A6: A4E4                       anda  ,s                       AND with $01 on stack
05A8: 26EA                       bne   L05FA            branch if not free
05AA: 6A61                       dec   1,s                      decrement counter on stack
05AC: E061                       subb  1,s
05AE: E141                       cmpb  R$A,u
